# Support SLT/SLTU instructions

- Source URL: https://github.com/KestrelComputer/polaris/pull/22

The SLT and SLTU instructions are decoded. However, the driver signals are never propagated to the ALU. Moreover, I don't think the ALU itself has SLT/SLTU functionality baked into it just yet.

Write bench tests to check for this condition.

Confirm malignant behavior with bench tests.

Propagate ltu_en from sequencer to ALU.

Propagate lts_en from sequencer to ALU.

Implement magnitude comparison logic in ALU. Probably borrow/re-use same logic as BLT and BLTU instructions.

